GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "024643FFD2C69555"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{2FC21118E1C97385}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "A US Army SBCT rifle platoon, supported by an MGS and an AH-64, will conduct an <b>ADVANCE TO CONTACT</b> towards Mulladost to clear the route and sweep the village."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
     "• The Rifle Platoon CO is in overall command."\
     "• An FO is required to coordinate CAS."\
     "• Due to a faction issue, select the USAF faction, then click the US faction to display all available slots."\
     ""\
     "<i><h2>This one will be hard! Sorry, not sorry.</h2></i>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B866A64EF2ED4006}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "The year is 2009, the country of Takistan has been invaided by coalition forces."\
     ""\
     "You are apart of a combined US, UK taskforce."\
     ""\
     "To the E UK forces are engaged in heavy fighting IVO Feruz Abad and USMC MEU forces further NE of them. HQ wants to open another route to Rasman. We have been diverted from our deployment on Sahrani to achieve this task."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "2'2 from our sister platoon has been tasked with doing dismounted route recon prior to our clearance. Expect updates from them on Company net."\
     ""
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EDC5C0D269FED277}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "1x SBCT Rifle Platoon(+) with x3 M2HB, x1 MK19 M1126"\
     "1x SBCT MGS"\
     ""\
     "We have QRF from 2'1 and 2'3 (respawns:x20) they're back at our SP with x2 M2HB combat load strykers. See mission notes."\
     ""\
     "The aviation asset is located at a FARP to the SouthEast and are TYPE 2 to the PL FO."\
     "Aviation has x1 AH-64 with rockets and hellfires."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8AC9D79F963EAD1D}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "ISR from a reaper spotted a Company sized group with a T72 and two platoons of BMP1s IVO Mulladost."\
     ""\
     "Static CSWs of AGS-17s, and NSVs are expected as well."\
     ""\
     "Along route to Mulladost ISR spotted EN setting up ambushes at the marked locations. They were actively placing AT mines on the road. With CSWs zeroed on sandbag positions."\
     ""\
     "Static AAA is in the area as a burst was heard before we lost contact with our MQ-9"\
     ""\
     "EN is likely to be reinforced by a third BMP1 platoon further down the route to Rasman."\
     ""\
     "Their weapons include AKs, M16s, FN-FALs, SVDs, RPKs, PKMs, RPGs."\
     ""\
     "They wear OD soviet style uniforms."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3D30701B30935A74}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "Mission: Clear the route to and town of Mulladost of TKA and hold it within 80min."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E9D2DBDFA1FF50D5}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "V. Sustainment"
     m_sContent "Only whats on the vehicles:"\
     "(Check the vic inv in the lobby)"\
     "Extra mags, boxes, grenades, LAWs, and x2 Javs per vic."\
     ""\
     "Vehicles have no RRR."
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C3F4E275B5631B12}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "VI. Comsig"
     m_sContent "Gound Element stay on default FREQs"\
     "Air net: +0.1MHz"\
     ""\
     "Callsigns: "\
     "1'6 - Rifle Platoon HQ"\
     "1'1 - Rifle Squad"\
     "1'2 - Rifle Squad"\
     "1'3 - Rifle Squad"\
     "1'4 - MMG Squad"\
     "3'1 - MGS"\
     ""\
     "AH-64 - Gunfighter 6'7"
     m_eAudience 2
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8480D7FA6FCE6918}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
     "<b>US VICTORY</b>"\
     "• Mulladost is cleared of TKA forces."\
     ""\
     "<b>US DEFEAT</b>"\
     "• 80 minutes elapse before the objective is completed."\
     "• US player casualties reach 80%."\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
     "• AO limits are in effect. The AH-64 is exempt from these restrictions."\
     "• 20x respawns | 60 second waves. Do not leave the staging point without a full Stryker."\
     "• JIP: TP."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION BY</h2>"\
     "jubxxxjub"
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
